					"nextDialogs": [
						400110610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110610,
					"content": "是不是可莉來得太慢，惹你生氣了？那…對不起嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110611,
					"content": "向對方道歉了？可莉這孩子，思維有點跳躍吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭芭拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110612,
					"content": "大——魔——王——！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110613,
					"content": "看起來，對方沒有要理睬可莉的意思呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭芭拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110614,
					"content": "是人型的機械吧。沒有反應，應該是已經損壞了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110615,
					"content": "妳認得那個嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭芭拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110616,
					"content": "只是猜測。它跟海島的整體氣氛格格不入…看衣著，倒像是從稻妻漂流而來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110617,
					"content": "稻妻？那不是很遠的地方嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110618,
					"content": "它也是異鄉人嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110619
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400110619,
					"content": "是的。這裡是獨立的海域，不跟任何國度接壤，對這片海洋而言，它也是異鄉人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110620,
					"content": "但以稻妻眼下的情況，又怎麼會發生這種事…",
