					"content": "當然啦，妳要相信我們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭芭拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110628,
					"content": "唔…不對，可莉想到了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110629,
					"content": "這個不是大魔王，真正的大魔王還在別的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110630,
					"content": "欸？是、是嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110631,
					"content": "可莉不會放棄，大魔王，等著吧，我們來找你！",
